{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ndシングル「おいでシャンプー」ウィークリー１位!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼(^O^)／☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついに念願の1位を獲得することができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーばいやばいやばい。信じられーん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど信じるけど、やっぱり信じられん('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも応援してくださるファミリーのみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとーうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーのみんなもいつもありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもみんなと一緒に頑張るっ(o>ω<o)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のことが大好きなファミリーさん、メンバー、みんながいてこその1位。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー重いねー深いねー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからしばらくはおいシャー・狼の披露期間だかんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてて下さい!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今日はね、学校でこんなことあったよー」って教えて下さいね?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子高生中元さんの日常が聞きたいですか(*^^*)?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は食堂デビューしたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから体育でダンスしたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや余裕かなと思ったら、結構ハードな(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じで楽しい毎日を送っておりますよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46がどうなったら一番嬉しい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方から愛されるアイドルになる!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかAKB48さんの公式ライバルってみなさんに認めていただけたら嬉しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会以外で、ファンの人との交流会をするとしたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"内容はどんなのがいいですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似顔絵会、録音会みたいななにかですよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーそうだ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長縄大会＼(^O^)／☆みんなで長縄するしかー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"身長158cmから伸びた?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがね、この冬159cmになりましたのよー拍手っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもねー、春に身長はかったら８mm縮んで158cmに戻った('・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どーゆーこっちゃねーん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめかに恋しちゃったらどうしたら良いん(≧≦)??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやあー照れるわあっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃあもうあれだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず中元日芽香で検索するしか(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手やお話もしたことないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログだけでファンになってもいいですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺もファミリーにはいっていいかな??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子でもひめきゅんになっても良いですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん一生1推しでいい??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとーう(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうねえ、聞かんでいいよう許可とかいらんよう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してくれるのほんま嬉しいよーう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん頑張るね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんもろってぃも大好きや!こういう場合はどうしたら良い?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんもろってぃ(川村真洋chan)大好きや!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃけひめたんがろってぃ大好きだから、あなたはひめたんを。黙。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちも仲良く応援してくれたら嬉しいな(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香は朝すぐ起きれる?強い方?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝はわりと強いよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーさんと一緒に寝たら、快く目覚まし係を引き受ける(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はほんと不規則!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきなりコメントしなくなったりすると"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この人から最近こないなー?って思ったりする?(。・ω・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/09/9450688/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰宅時間が遅くなってコメする時間があまりないんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２日３日にコメしても見てくれるかな??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃもちろん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忙しいのにコメントまで書いてくれてありがとうですっ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無理はせんでねー?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}